            "review_text": "Tour06487866338\n2 contributions\n0\nEnjoying the familiar.\nJun 2026 • Friends\nI was really disappointed by the host’s arrogance and dishonest behavior when I only wanted to contribute to the quality of the ingredients prepared for my table.\n\nIf the dish is not a problem, I have no opinion, the purpose I gently tell the owner is to let them pay attention or review the preparation of the kitchen ingredients before cleaning up for the guests.\n\nThe owner seems to lack the awareness and wisdom to find out where the problem is that rushing with words that seem to be interested but ironic, blame is the problem in the guests. \n\nWhen I gently contribute to the owner what I wish to receive is listening with respect and sensitivity to re-examine but I myself have no need to have the owner pick up all the food and make it new.\n\nThe small but uncomfortable and wise behavior of the owner disappointed me and I myself would never come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten June 17, 2026",
