            "review_title": "Review at La Dong Rieng",
            "review_text": "Ted L\nOakland20 contributions\n0\nBlink and you’ll miss out of the ordinary good Vietnamese food\nDec 2017 • Family\nMy family was staying nearby and were looking for a restaurant with A/C to survive the heat. We found this gem. They had several great Vietnamese seafood dishes such as Vietnamese seafood fried rice, seafood salad, and a very good squid dish. Other Vietnamese dishes were available. It took a bit of sign language but we had stumbled into lunch time buffet. The buffet offerings were good, at least the soup that we tried. We ordered a special-special to us-tamarind juice drink. Exotic and good. The staff were very nice and helpful.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 1, 2018",
